WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
AtlasGrid opens with an analytical posture, not an approval: the workflow is on hold, human authority is pending, and the decision record is unsigned.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The first read states the decisive evidence, the loss mechanism, and the exact diligence gate before exposing model detail.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Predeclared return tests can clear while unresolved evidence still prevents the case from advancing.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Every decision-facing number opens from business meaning into its calculation, retained source selection, and audit metadata.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:02.000
The deal room is searchable by business meaning across sources, findings, analyses, owners, and open requests.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Econometric classification changes the investment model: associations receive zero credit and synthetic effects remain bounded to their tested population.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:36.000
AtlasGrid compares seller ask, selected structure, and downside through retained model results rather than presentation-only changes.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:47.000
The exact case, room, scenario, sensitivity driver, and cell are encoded in a stable, restorable URL.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Helios reuses the same evidence, judgment, scenario, and receipt contracts for a milestone-financed venture investment.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:12.000
The interface distinguishes current runway, funded runway, and the no-tranche cash path while separating first-close and conditional capital.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:23.000
A failed milestone withholds the tranche and reruns capitalization, runway, preferences, dated cash flows, ownership, and returns.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:30.000
The final layer turns evidence into an owned operating plan with costs, milestones, stop rules, and a reconciled value bridge.
